@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 10
actor User
participant Client
participant "Hospital A Source" as HospA
participant "Hospital B Source" as HospB
participant Gateway
participant "Storage" as Storage
participant "Chain: Anchor/Attest" as Chain

== Fetch & compare ==
User -> Client: open reconciliation view(resource type)
Client -> HospA: fetch CID_A + attest
Client -> HospB: fetch CID_B + attest
Client -> Client: verify signatures/anchors; decrypt
Client -> Client: diff resources; mark conflicts; show provenance chips

== Resolve ==
User -> Client: choose resolution (A, B, or merge)
Client -> Client: produce merged resource; encrypt -> CID_M
Client -> Gateway: submit merge metadata (sources, mergeOps, CID_M, patientDID)
Gateway -> Chain: anchor CID_M hash/Merkle; record provenance (CID_A, CID_B, resolver DID)

== Publish ==
Gateway -> Storage: pin merged ciphertext (if not already)
Gateway -> Gateway: emit audit (reconciliation, sources, resolver)
Chain: updated anchor now authoritative pointer
Client -> Client: refresh view with merged record
@enduml
